CAMPAIGN_RANKING
3

OBJECTIVE_BEGIN
Niflheim's centralized location within the Arcturan band makes it an excellent location for munitions storage. To secure Niflheim for our construction teams, capture all of the citadels in the Hot Zone. 
OBJECTIVE_END

SPYINFO_BEGIN
1
A large river separates the two halves of the Hot Zone. A citadel with an extensive supply of energy lies on an ice sheet to the west.
SPYINFO_END

DESCRIPTION_BEGIN
Niflheim is the training ground for Imperial forces. Munitions stored there would be useful, and its capture would be an organizational blow to the Imperial navy.
DESCRIPTION_END

